WEBVTT

NOTE Full translated speech. Cue starts use source speech alignment.
End holds may extend within the observed pause before the next cue.

ngb-pesquisa-001
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
In São João del-Rei, Minas Gerais,

ngb-pesquisa-002
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Instituto Virtudes worked with families
from the NGO Nova Geração Brasil

ngb-pesquisa-003
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
in five sessions devoted to cultivating
four virtues:

ngb-pesquisa-004
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
humility, gentleness, patience and
responsibility.

ngb-pesquisa-005
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
In a few weeks, the changes were real and
visible.

ngb-pesquisa-006
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Virtue can be practiced,

ngb-pesquisa-007
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.450 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
and these are the voices of those who
experienced it.

ngb-pesquisa-008
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
What happened?

ngb-pesquisa-009
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I got angry and shouted.

ngb-pesquisa-010
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
You got angry and shouted.

ngb-pesquisa-011
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
What did you feel, Laurinha?

ngb-pesquisa-012
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I could control my emotions...

ngb-pesquisa-013
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Is that responsibility?

ngb-pesquisa-014
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.700 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I lied so I would not get scolded.

ngb-pesquisa-015
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
You lied to avoid being scolded.

ngb-pesquisa-016
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
What did you feel, Conrado?

ngb-pesquisa-017
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Fear.

ngb-pesquisa-018
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Fear...

ngb-pesquisa-019
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
That is why you lied, right?

ngb-pesquisa-020
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
What could you do differently?

ngb-pesquisa-021
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Tell them... that I did it...

ngb-pesquisa-022
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
and not lie, right?

ngb-pesquisa-023
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And that suggestion of yours

ngb-pesquisa-024
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:06.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
is very good. Why? Because that is what it
means to develop neuroplasticity.

ngb-pesquisa-026
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Do you see? But here, a habit was formed.

ngb-pesquisa-027
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:13.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
A new habit that, over 20 days, 50 days,

ngb-pesquisa-028
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
becomes part of the person, because it is
a new habit they have acquired.

ngb-pesquisa-029
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
We have an autistic grandson,

ngb-pesquisa-030
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
and he has been here at the NGO for about
three years, more or less.

ngb-pesquisa-031
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
He really likes it here.

ngb-pesquisa-032
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And Virtology is teaching us to deal with
the problem

ngb-pesquisa-033
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
that he has.

ngb-pesquisa-034
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And now they have also given us a book,
which is very good.

ngb-pesquisa-035
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
You have to learn how to deal with autism.

ngb-pesquisa-036
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Keep going, right?

ngb-pesquisa-037
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I could not really study,

ngb-pesquisa-038
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
and I only finished eighth grade,

ngb-pesquisa-039
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
but I have life experience.

ngb-pesquisa-040
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
So I have been learning more and more with
you here.

ngb-pesquisa-041
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I am very grateful, and I hope to
continue.

ngb-pesquisa-042
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
It helped. It helps us have more humility,

ngb-pesquisa-043
00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.570 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
not lose our temper so much.

ngb-pesquisa-044
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Knowledge, and knowledge to help the
family.

ngb-pesquisa-045
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:02.850 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
It was very good.
